OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers on six routes get
OL,4,Atemporary toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew temporary toilets have been
OL,7,Finstalled for drivers of six London bus
OL,8,Froutes without facilities at either
OL,9,Fterminus.
OL,11,FDrivers on the affected routes will
OL,12,Fhave "improved access to facilities at
OL,13,Ftheir termini, rather than needing to
OL,14,Frely on facilities mid-route or a short
OL,15,Fwalk away", Transport for London (TfL)
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FThe authority said it was planning to
OL,19,Fbuild an additional 53 new toilet
OL,20,Fbuildings for bus drivers across the
OL,21,Fcapital over the next three years.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
