OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers on six routes get
OL,4,Atemporary toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Unite union said the measure was
OL,7,Fwelcomed, but TfL needed to be quicker
OL,8,Fin providing facilities as "some
OL,9,Fdrivers are still taking toilet breaks
OL,10,Fby the side of the road".
